  "display_title": "The Fox's Failed Feast",
  "description": "Despite his kind face and good reputation, Ha-Yun's hobby are one-night stands. One day, he becomes captivated by Seo-Jin, a new member of his club, and decides to try sleeping with him. Contrary to his thuggish appearance, with his tanned skin, muscular build, and bright yellow hair, Seo-Jin is the epitome of innocence. Ha-Yun manages to break through his innocence and have a one-night stand with him, but the next day, he tries to sort things out...\n\n*\"I agreed because I like you, hyung.\"\n\n\"This is my first time dating.\"*\n\nHow can he get this out of his head...?\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
